{"seq":1,"slug":"terrain-lod","title":"地形 LOD 系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-procedural-terrain/rendering/terrain-lod","wordCount":1254,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"地形-lod-系统\">地形 LOD 系统</h1><p>大型地形的核心渲染挑战是：近处需要高精度的细密网格来呈现石块级别的细节，远处只需要几个三角形勾勒山脉轮廓。LOD（Level of Detail）系统根据与相机的距离动态调整地形网格的精度。地形 LOD 的特殊挑战在于&quot;缝合问题&quot;（T-junction）——不同 LOD 级别相邻时，高精度块的边缘顶点在低精度块上没有对应点，会产生可见裂缝。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>CDLOD（连续距离相关 LOD）</strong>：以四叉树组织地形节点，根据相机距离选择对应 LOD 级别的网格，通过顶点着色器内的 Morphing 插值消除不同 LOD 之间切换时的&quot;弹出&quot;感</li>\n<li><strong>T-junction 裂缝问题</strong>：高 LOD 块边缘顶点在相邻低 LOD 块上无对应点，导致渲染时产生可见缝隙；Skirt（裙边）是最常见的低成本修复方案</li>\n<li><strong>Morphing 因子</strong>：在 LOD 切换距离附近，顶点在当前 LOD 位置和更粗糙 LOD 位置之间线性插值，使过渡连续不跳变</li>\n<li><strong>视锥体剔除</strong>：对四叉树每个节点做包围盒与相机视锥体的相交测试，跳过不可见节点，大幅降低绘制调用数量</li>\n<li><strong>GPU Indirect Draw</strong>：将四叉树遍历和实例数据生成移至 GPU Compute Shader，CPU 只发出一次 DrawIndirect 调用，消除 CPU-GPU 的提交瓶颈</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[相机位置] --&gt; B[四叉树遍历]&#10;    B --&gt; C{与相机距离?}&#10;    C --&gt;|近, &lt; LOD0 范围| D[选 LOD0 叶节点]&#10;    C --&gt;|中, LOD1 范围| E[选 LOD1 节点]&#10;    C --&gt;|远, LOD2+ 范围| F[选粗糙节点]&#10;    D &amp; E &amp; F --&gt; G[视锥体剔除]&#10;    G --&gt; H[Morphing 顶点着色器]&#10;    H --&gt; I[Skirt 边缘缝合]&#10;    I --&gt; J[渲染输出]\">flowchart TD\n    A[相机位置] --&gt; B[四叉树遍历]\n    B --&gt; C{与相机距离?}\n    C --&gt;|近, &lt; LOD0 范围| D[选 LOD0 叶节点]\n    C --&gt;|中, LOD1 范围| E[选 LOD1 节点]\n    C --&gt;|远, LOD2+ 范围| F[选粗糙节点]\n    D &amp; E &amp; F --&gt; G[视锥体剔除]\n    G --&gt; H[Morphing 顶点着色器]\n    H --&gt; I[Skirt 边缘缝合]\n    I --&gt; J[渲染输出]</pre><h2 id=\"lod-架构选型\">LOD 架构选型</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方案</th>\n<th>原理</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>缺点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>均匀网格 + 几何误差</td>\n<td>简单，按距离切换 LOD</td>\n<td>实现简单</td>\n<td>切换时弹出感</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Geomipmapping</td>\n<td>以 Chunk 为单位多级 LOD</td>\n<td>经典，工程成熟</td>\n<td>缝合处理复杂</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ROAM</td>\n<td>基于误差的自适应三角形细分</td>\n<td>精度高</td>\n<td>GPU 不友好</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>CDLOD</strong></td>\n<td>四叉树 + 连续 LOD 插值</td>\n<td>无缝、GPU 友好</td>\n<td>需要 VS Morphing</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GPU Tessellation</td>\n<td>硬件细分</td>\n<td>可细化到亚像素</td>\n<td>老硬件不支持</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>现代游戏引擎主流方案是 <strong>CDLOD</strong>（Continuous Distance-Dependent LOD），由 Filip Strugar（2010）提出。Unreal Engine 的地形系统和大量 AAA 游戏使用了这一方案或其变体。</p>\n<h2 id=\"cdlod-四叉树架构\">CDLOD：四叉树架构</h2><p>CDLOD 将地形划分为<strong>四叉树</strong>，叶节点是固定分辨率的网格块（Patch），内部节点代表更低 LOD 的粗略版本：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"LOD0 (最精细，近处)&#10;    ┌──┬──┐&#10;    │  │  │  ← 64 个顶点/格&#10;    ├──┼──┤&#10;    │  │  │&#10;    └──┴──┘&#10;&#10;LOD1 (中距离)&#10;    ┌────┐&#10;    │    │  ← 32 个顶点/格（分辨率降低一半）&#10;    └────┘&#10;&#10;LOD2 (远处)&#10;    ┌────┐&#10;    │    │  ← 16 个顶点/格&#10;    └────┘\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>LOD0 (最精细，近处)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ┌──┬──┐</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    │  │  │  ← 64 个顶点/格</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ├──┼──┤</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    │  │  │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    └──┴──┘</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>LOD1 (中距离)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ┌────┐</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    │    │  ← 32 个顶点/格（分辨率降低一半）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    └────┘</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>LOD2 (远处)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ┌────┐</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    │    │  ← 16 个顶点/格</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    └────┘</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"四叉树节点\">四叉树节点</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cpp\" data-code=\"struct TerrainNode {&#10;    float   centerX, centerZ;  // 节点中心世界坐标&#10;    float   halfSize;          // 节点半边长（米）&#10;    int     lodLevel;          // LOD 级别（0 = 最精细）&#10;    bool    isLeaf;&#10;&#10;    // 子节点（LOD 更高，面积更小）&#10;    std::unique_ptr&lt;TerrainNode&gt; children[4]; // NW, NE, SW, SE&#10;};&#10;&#10;// 四叉树深度 = maxLOD - 1&#10;// 叶节点面积 = leafPatchSize × leafPatchSize&#10;// 根节点面积 = worldSize × worldSize\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TerrainNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">   centerX, centerZ;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 节点中心世界坐标</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">   halfSize;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">          // 节点半边长（米）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">     lodLevel;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">          // LOD 级别（0 = 最精细）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    bool</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    isLeaf;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 子节点（LOD 更高，面积更小）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    std</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::unique_ptr</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">TerrainNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> children[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> // NW, NE, SW, SE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 四叉树深度 = maxLOD - 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 叶节点面积 = leafPatchSize × leafPatchSize</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 根节点面积 = worldSize × worldSize</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"可见性剔除与-lod-选择\">可见性剔除与 LOD 选择</h3><p>使用<strong>视锥体剔除</strong> + <strong>距离启发式</strong>决定每个节点是否需要细分：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cpp\" data-code=\"struct Camera {&#10;    glm::vec3 pos;&#10;    float fov, aspect, near, far;&#10;    // 视锥体平面（6个）&#10;    glm::vec4 frustumPlanes[6];&#10;};&#10;&#10;bool nodeInFrustum(const TerrainNode&amp; node, const Camera&amp; cam) {&#10;    // AABB 与视锥体的分离轴测试&#10;    for (auto&amp; plane : cam.frustumPlanes) {&#10;        float dist = plane.x * node.centerX + plane.z * node.centerZ + plane.w;&#10;        if (dist &lt; -node.halfSize * std::sqrt(2.0f)) return false;&#10;    }&#10;    return true;&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 是否需要细分此节点（LOD 选择核心判断）&#10;bool shouldSubdivide(const TerrainNode&amp; node, const Camera&amp; cam,&#10;                      float lodDistanceScale) {&#10;    float dx = cam.pos.x - node.centerX;&#10;    float dz = cam.pos.z - node.centerZ;&#10;    float dist = std::sqrt(dx*dx + dz*dz);&#10;    // LOD 切换距离：节点大小 × 缩放系数&#10;    float threshold = node.halfSize * 2.0f * lodDistanceScale;&#10;    return dist &lt; threshold;&#10;}&#10;&#10;void traverseQuadtree(const TerrainNode&amp; node, const Camera&amp; cam,&#10;                        std::vector&lt;const TerrainNode*&gt;&amp; visible,&#10;                        float lodDistanceScale) {&#10;    if (!nodeInFrustum(node, cam)) return; // 视锥体外，完全剔除&#10;&#10;    if (node.isLeaf || !shouldSubdivide(node, cam, lodDistanceScale)) {&#10;        visible.push_back(&amp;node); // 作为一个 LOD 块渲染&#10;        return;&#10;    }&#10;    // 否则递归细分四个子节点&#10;    for (auto&amp; child : node.children) {&#10;        if (child) traverseQuadtree(*child, cam, visible, lodDistanceScale);&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Camera</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    glm</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::vec3 pos;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fov, aspect, near, far;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 视锥体平面（6个）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    glm</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::vec4 frustumPlanes[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bool</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> nodeInFrustum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TerrainNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> node</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Camera</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> cam</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // AABB 与视锥体的分离轴测试</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">auto&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> plane : cam.frustumPlanes) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dist </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> plane.x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> node.centerX </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> plane.z </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> node.centerZ </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> plane.w;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (dist </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">node.halfSize </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> std</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sqrt</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2.0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 是否需要细分此节点（LOD 选择核心判断）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bool</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> shouldSubdivide</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--